  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, the aethernaut can rebuild his device once per day with 8 hours of work. This can change the device to be any item of the same device category (and item slot, if it has one) and equal or lower market price as the device, to a maximum of one-quarter the wealth by level<sup>CRB</sup> for a character of his aethernaut level. He must succeed at the Craft or Spellcraft check to create the new item; if he fails, the device is not modified.</p>\n<p>At 13th level, using this ability takes only 1 hour and the maximum value is one-third the wealth by level for a character of the aethernaut's level.</p>\n<p>At 19th level, the aethernaut can use this ability as a full-round action once per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aethernaut#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
